 * onboard-centre.ts — Automated Code Ninjas Centre Onboarding
 *
 * Provisions a new centre across Twilio, Retell, Cekura, ChatDash, and Hiya
 * in a single command. Executes 10 sequential steps with rollback-aware logging.
 *
 * Usage:
 *   bun /root/lead-reactivation-github/scripts/onboard-centre.ts \
 *     --name "Leaside" --area-code "647" --country CA \
 *     --owner-name "Sharmila" --owner-email "sharmila@example.com"
