<!-- STEP 3: KNOWLEDGE BASE -->
<h2 style="color: #1a73e8; border-bottom: 2px solid #1a73e8; padding-bottom: 8px;">Step 3: Knowledge Base</h2>
<p>The AI agent uses a Knowledge Base document to answer questions about your centre (hours, pricing, programs, etc.). You'll create your own copy and customize it with your centre's details.</p>

<h4>Step 1: Copy the Reference Document</h4>
<ol>
